        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🗽 STRANGLEHOLD OF THE ELITE 🩸</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Reverse Bullet Heaven Political Horror Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the chaos of a crumbling America.</strong><br>In this unholy blend of satire, action, and surreal horror, <i>Stranglehold of the Elite</i> flips the bullet heaven genre on its head. Choose your favorite (or most feared) political figure and wade into the festering heart of a nation devoured by corruption, conspiracies, and brain rot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play</strong><br>Become a twisted version of America’s most powerful. Each has unique abilities, sordid lore, and a personal stake in the madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight</strong><br>Dodge relentless attacks, consume influence, and unleash devastating rhetoric in this reverse bullet hell where you’re not the predator—you’re the prey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Win</strong><br>Uncover the truth behind the rot, survive the descent, and ascend as the last leader standing. Or don’t. The swamp remembers everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reverse bullet hell mechanics with an evolving battlefield</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satirical and sinister reimaginings of real political figures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep visual storytelling with a stylized pixel feel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lore-rich encounters with monsters born from conspiracy theories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive soundtrack that blends chaos, paranoia, and power</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The swamp is calling. Are you brave—or corrupt—enough to answer?</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🗽 STRANGLEHOLD OF THE ELITE 🩸</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Reverse Bullet Heaven Political Horror Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the chaos of a crumbling America.</strong><br>In this unholy blend of satire, action, and surreal horror, <i>Stranglehold of the Elite</i> flips the bullet heaven genre on its head. Choose your favorite (or most feared) political figure and wade into the festering heart of a nation devoured by corruption, conspiracies, and brain rot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play</strong><br>Become a twisted version of America’s most powerful. Each has unique abilities, sordid lore, and a personal stake in the madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight</strong><br>Dodge relentless attacks, consume influence, and unleash devastating rhetoric in this reverse bullet hell where you’re not the predator—you’re the prey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Win</strong><br>Uncover the truth behind the rot, survive the descent, and ascend as the last leader standing. Or don’t. The swamp remembers everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reverse bullet hell mechanics with an evolving battlefield</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satirical and sinister reimaginings of real political figures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep visual storytelling with a stylized pixel feel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lore-rich encounters with monsters born from conspiracy theories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive soundtrack that blends chaos, paranoia, and power</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The swamp is calling. Are you brave—or corrupt—enough to answer?</strong></p>",
        "short_description": "Stranglehold of the Elite is a reverse bullet heaven where you play as twisted political icons battling through a decaying America. Dodge chaos, uncover conspiracies, and survive the collapse. The swamp is deep—and it’s hungry.",
